<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="light" lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-surface-bright text-on-surface hf-dashboard">
    <% const settingsUser = typeof currentUser === 'object' && currentUser ? currentUser : {}; %>
    <% const displayName = settingsUser.fullName || 'Landlord'; %>
    <%- include('../partials/sidebar-landlord') %>

    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 flex min-h-16 items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface px-4 shadow-sm md:pl-[264px] md:pr-8">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <p class="truncate text-label-sm font-bold text-secondary">Landlord workspace</p>
        <p class="truncate text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"><%= displayName %></p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2">
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/notification-bell" aria-label="Notifications" title="Notifications"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">notifications</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/messages" aria-label="Messages" title="Messages"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">chat_bubble</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/settings" aria-label="Settings" title="Settings" aria-current="page"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">settings</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/user-profile" aria-label="Landlord profile" title="Landlord profile"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">person</span></a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="w-full px-4 py-6 md:ml-[240px] md:w-[calc(100%-240px)] md:px-8 md:py-8 hf-dashboard-main">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="mb-8">
          <p class="mb-1 text-label-md font-bold text-secondary">Account controls</p>
          <h1 class="text-headline-lg font-bold text-primary">Settings</h1>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Review account details and open the settings journeys currently supported by this application.</p>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-8 border-y border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-6 sm:px-6" aria-labelledby="settings-availability-title">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary" aria-hidden="true">settings</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase text-secondary">Current capability</p>
                <h2 id="settings-availability-title" class="mt-1 text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Profile and access journeys are available</h2>
                <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Listing defaults, application-review preferences, notification preferences, email changes, data exports, and account deletion do not have persisted settings handlers yet.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-4 text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">Read-only summary</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 xl:grid-cols-12">
          <div class="space-y-8 xl:col-span-8">
            <section aria-labelledby="account-settings-title">
              <div class="mb-4">
                <h2 id="account-settings-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Account</h2>
                <p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">These values come from the authenticated account.</p>
              </div>
              <dl class="divide-y divide-outline-variant rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest text-body-sm">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><div><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Email address</dt><dd class="mt-1 break-all text-on-surface-variant"><%= settingsUser.email || 'Not available' %></dd></div><span class="font-bold text-on-surface-variant">Change unavailable</span></div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><div><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Workspace role</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-on-surface-variant">Landlord</dd></div><span class="font-bold text-on-surface-variant">Role change unavailable</span></div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><div><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Password access</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-on-surface-variant">Use the email-based recovery journey to set a new password.</dd></div><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center font-bold text-primary hover:underline" href="/forget-password">Reset password</a></div>
              </dl>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="profile-settings-title">
              <div class="mb-4">
                <h2 id="profile-settings-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Profile and portfolio</h2>
                <p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Use the existing account and onboarding pages for saved profile context.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <a class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5 transition-colors hover:border-primary" href="/user/landlord/user-profile"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">person</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Account profile</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Review the landlord profile workspace and account presentation.</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-bold text-primary">Open profile</span></a>
                <a class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5 transition-colors hover:border-primary" href="/onboarding-landlord"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">domain</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Onboarding details</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Update saved account type, portfolio estimate, locations, and management context.</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-bold text-primary">Update details</span></a>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="preference-status-title">
              <div class="mb-4">
                <h2 id="preference-status-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Preference status</h2>
                <p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Controls are shown only when the server can store and enforce their value.</p>
              </div>
              <dl class="divide-y divide-outline-variant rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest text-body-sm">
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Listing defaults</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Application review preferences</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">In-app notification preferences</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Email notification preferences</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </section>
          </div>

          <aside class="space-y-6 xl:col-span-4" aria-label="Account settings guidance">
            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6" aria-labelledby="privacy-requests-title">
              <h2 id="privacy-requests-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Privacy requests</h2>
              <p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Automated data export and account deletion are not configured. Contact support for the current request process and do not send identity documents in the first message.</p>
              <a class="mt-5 inline-flex min-h-12 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-primary px-5 font-bold text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/contact#contact-form"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">contact_support</span>Contact support</a>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6" aria-labelledby="settings-boundaries-title">
              <h2 id="settings-boundaries-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Current boundaries</h2>
              <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">info</span><span>No unsaved toggle is presented as an account preference.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">info</span><span>Email and role changes need separate verified workflows.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">info</span><span>Account deletion needs confirmation, re-authentication, and lifecycle cleanup.</span></li>
              </ul>
              <a class="mt-5 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 font-bold text-primary hover:underline" href="/logout"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">logout</span>Sign out</a>
            </section>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
